--- stderr
no VMs visible on node pve — the API token cannot see any VMs.
  Fix: grant VM.Audit on /vms to the token's user, OR
       edit the token in Datacenter → Permissions → API Tokens
       and uncheck 'Privilege Separation' so it inherits the user's rights.
  See README.md → 'Required permissions' for the full list.
